        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a full-service real estate company, with substantial in-house expertise and resources in acquisitions, development, financing, capital markets, construction management, property management, marketing, leasing, accounting, risk management, tax and legal services.",
